# EHP Proof Tracer

EHP Proof Tracer is a Python project for representing, checking, searching, explaining, presenting, exploring, and safely executing theorem-backed Toda-style homotopy-group calculations.

The project currently focuses on the 2-primary Toda groups, EHP exactness, explicit proof provenance, the calculation spine through stable stems $G_0$ to $G_7$, theorem-backed repository exploration, recursive proof-ancestry exploration, applicable theorem / lemma discovery, relevance classification, and a bounded handoff path from a selected applicability candidate to actual proof execution.

